{"version":1,"content":"<p>近年將事業重心轉移至內地的李彩華（Rain），憑藉驚人的吸金能力賺得盆滿缽滿。</p><p>圈中傳聞她坐擁多達12個物業、身家已突破2億大關，是名副其實的「隱形小富婆」！</p><p>今日（11日）迎來43歲生日的她，更獲多家頂級奢華名牌包場慶祝，排場極盡尊貴。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:17:02.054034+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.682952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.682952+00:00","content_hash":"c275fd530c974bc9a3b3c0ff74b409cbd69d8b0467f650fa4d2bb11a27a75b97","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}